     A*=======================================================================
     A* Institution: Muskegon Community College
     A* Course:      CIS170 - Intro to RPG Programming
     A* Instructor:  Char Parker
     A* Project:     Project #4 Part C - ACME Employee Productivity Report
     A* File:        PRJ4CPRTF.PRTF
     A* Programmer:  Chris Grimm
     A* Date:        09/30/2020
     A*
     A* Description:
     A*   External printer file definition for ACME Employee Productivity
     A*   Report. Defines system report headers, zero-suppressed page
     A*   numbering (EDTCDE(Z)), two-tier column headings, and employee
     A*   detail rows with SSN edit words and formatted productivity metrics.
     A*
     A* Used By:     PROJECT4C.RPGLE
     A*=======================================================================
     A          R HEADING                   SKIPB(1)
     A                                     8DATE(*YY)
     A                                      EDTCDE(Y)
     A                                    45'ACME Employee Productivity Report'
     A                                   117'Page'
     A                                   123PAGNBR
     A                                      EDTCDE(Z)
     A                                      SPACEA(2)
     A                                     3'Social Security'
     A                                    41'Hours'
     A                                    55'Quantity'
     A                                    76'Quantity'
     A                                      SPACEA(1)
     A                                     6'Number'
     A                                    21'Name'
     A                                    41'Worked'
     A                                    55'Produced'
     A                                    76'Produced per Hour'
     A                                      SPACEA(1)
     A*-----------------------------------------------------------------------
     A          R DETAIL                    SPACEB(1)
     A            D_SOCSEC       9S 0      4EDTWRD('   -  -    ')
     A            D_NAME        16A       21
     A            D_WKHOURS      5S 2     40EDTCDE(1)
     A            D_QTY          5S 0     57EDTCDE(1)
     A            D_QTYPHR       5S 2     78EDTCDE(1)

